cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "desml - machine-learning prediction of API solubility in deep eutectic solvents"
abstract: >-
  Code for predicting the mole-fraction solubility of active pharmaceutical
  ingredients in deep eutectic solvents from RDKit physicochemical descriptors
  and molecular graphs, without quantum-chemical calculations.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kiku-1102/des-api-solubility-ml"
url: "https://github.com/kiku-1102/des-api-solubility-ml"
